        <item>
            <title>0.8.9</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 11:58:38 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.8.9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.8.9</h2>
<ul>
<li>Folder arrange, rebuilt on the same engine as everything else: dragging, swapping, linked and unlinked pairs, and empty slots now follow exactly the same rules and animations as the main ring — live make-way, the clock-hand pair turn, and pills settling from under your cursor</li>
<li>Right-click editing works on folder pills and their outer (⌥) pills; folders show one badge per state — pencil when closed (edit the pill), gear when open (arrange the folder)</li>
<li>Editing no longer closes the menu: saving or closing an edit popup returns you to where you were — including Arrange mode, which also got a visible ✕ and click-outside-to-close</li>
<li>Slot numbers in the folder arrange, matching the main ring</li>
<li>Sub-menu layout is identical in Arrange and live use (pills no longer shift when entering arrange)</li>
<li>The folder&#x27;s name and look now appear in the center hub of its menu (it was empty)</li>
<li>Accidental fires fixed: leftover swipe momentum after a Compass switch can&#x27;t trigger a pill, and closing an edit popup can&#x27;t fire one on your next mouse move</li>
<li>The auto-recenter sound follows the flight&#x27;s length and loudness; the flight speed itself is unchanged</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
